sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant C as BrokenCollector
  participant F as BrokenFinder
  participant A as Assessor
  participant Q as Quarantine
  participant B as BrokenReview
  participant E as RepairEncoder
  participant D as DownloaderDatabase
  U->>C: broken --collect
  C->>F: find()
  F-->>C: (path, reason) from shrink.db / report
  loop each video
    C->>A: assess(path)
    A-->>C: Assessment (decodes, still, errors, class)
  end
  C->>U: plan, confirm?
  U-->>C: y
  loop each video
    C->>Q: collect(path, assessment, reason)
    Q->>Q: rename every hard link name into _broken/<class>/...
    Q->>Q: write manifest.jsonl
  end
  U->>B: broken --review
  loop promising (most usable first), then hopeless
    B->>U: measurement, choice?
    alt repair
      B->>E: encode(held, repaired-<name>)
      E-->>B: validated (full decode without errors)
      U-->>B: accept
      B->>Q: install(item, repaired)
    else keep
      B->>Q: restore(item) (BROKEN, kept after review)
    else delete
      B->>Q: delete(item)
      B->>D: reset(original)
    end
  end
